# Squirrel: Squirrel 3.2 Reference Manual: The language; requirements/languages/squirrel.md
name     squirrel nut
keyword  base break case catch class clone continue const default delete else enum extends for foreach
keyword  function if in local null resume return switch this throw try typeof while yield constructor
keyword  instanceof static
builtin  true false print array
line-comment   // #
block-comment  /* */
string   " "  : escapes
string   ' '  : escapes
prefix   @    : verbatim
operators  +-*/%&|^!<>=:?~.
calls
